			"notes": {
				"rationale": "weitergeleitet werden is the process passive of weiterleiten, 'pass on what one received to another person or office': werden is its passive auxiliary and joins it, and weiter is its separable prefix (de/verbal-participle, de/verb-core-features). an die Rentner names the recipient that weiterleiten asks for (DWDS: die Freiexemplare sind an alle Autoren weiterzuleiten), so an + Acc is governed, a member left out of the normalized Surface (de/governed-preposition-joins-its-governor)."
